{"seq":2,"slug":"throughput-gains","title":"吞吐提升与度量：把机制翻译成数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/practice/throughput-gains","wordCount":1517,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"吞吐提升与度量-把机制翻译成数字\">吞吐提升与度量：把机制翻译成数字</h1><p>前面几篇讲的都是「怎么做」，这一篇回答「值多少」。分页 + 连续批处理 + 共享究竟带来多大收益，不能停在「快很多」的模糊感受上，得落到可测量、可对比的指标。这一篇建立一套度量语言——TTFT、TPOT、吞吐、显存利用率——再用它读懂 PagedAttention 那些惊人的数字，以及这些数字背后的因果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个必须分清的指标\">核心概念：三个必须分清的指标</h2><p>评价推理服务，至少要同时看三个维度，混为一谈会得出错误结论：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TTFT（首 token 延迟）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>请求到达</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>第一个 token 产出</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TTFT（首 token 延迟）} = \\text{请求到达} \\to \\text{第一个 token 产出}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTFT</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（首</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延迟）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">请求到达</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第一个</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产出</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TPOT（每 token 延迟）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>解码总时间</mtext><mtext>生成 token 数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>吞吐</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>所有请求生成的总 token 数</mtext><mtext>墙钟时间</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TPOT（每 token 延迟）} = \\frac{\\text{解码总时间}}{\\text{生成 token 数}}, \\quad \\text{吞吐} = \\frac{\\text{所有请求生成的总 token 数}}{\\text{墙钟时间}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TPOT</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（每</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延迟）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生成</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解码总时间</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">吞吐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">墙钟时间</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有请求生成的总</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>TTFT 由 prefill 决定，关乎用户「等多久看到回应开始」；TPOT 由 decode 每步决定，关乎「文字流出来的快慢」；吞吐是系统级的总产出，关乎「一张卡能服务多少人、单 token 多少钱」。三者常此消彼长：把批量堆大能拉高吞吐，却可能抬高单个请求的 TTFT/TPOT。PagedAttention 的独特价值在于——它主要通过省显存来提升吞吐，而对单请求延迟的损伤很小。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[分页省下 KV 显存] --&gt; B[可容纳更大批量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[decode 访存受限被摊薄]&#10;  C --&gt; D[吞吐大幅提升]&#10;  B --&gt; E[单请求延迟几乎不变]&#10;  D --&gt; F[单 token 成本下降]&#10;  E --&gt; G[用户体验不退化]&#10;  F --&gt; H[同硬件服务更多用户]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[分页省下 KV 显存] --&gt; B[可容纳更大批量]\n  B --&gt; C[decode 访存受限被摊薄]\n  C --&gt; D[吞吐大幅提升]\n  B --&gt; E[单请求延迟几乎不变]\n  D --&gt; F[单 token 成本下降]\n  E --&gt; G[用户体验不退化]\n  F --&gt; H[同硬件服务更多用户]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"分页为何主要提吞吐\">分页为何主要提吞吐</h2><p>要理解「为什么是吞吐、而非延迟」受益最大，得回到 decode 的本质：它是访存受限（memory-bound）负载。生成一个 token，主要时间花在把模型权重从显存搬进计算单元，真正的乘加运算反而不占主导。单个请求根本喂不饱算力，大量张量核心在空转。</p>\n<p>批量就是解药。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求凑成一批，权重只搬一次却服务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求，那份固定的搬运成本被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求摊薄，硬件利用率随批量上升而上升——直到算力或带宽饱和。而批量能开多大，几乎完全由 KV 显存决定，见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-paged-attention\">为何分页注意力</a>。分页把显存浪费从 60–80% 压到 4% 以下，等于把可容纳的批量放大数倍，吞吐随之数倍增长。至于单请求的 TTFT/TPOT，因为每一步的计算量没变、只是并行了更多请求，几乎不受影响。这就是分页「几乎只赚吞吐、不亏延迟」的物理原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读懂那些数字\">读懂那些数字</h2><p>有了因果，再看社区与论文的数字就不再是空洞的营销。下表汇总几个有代表性的量化结果及其来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>条件 / 来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KV 显存浪费</td>\n<td>从 60–80% 降到 &lt;4%</td>\n<td>PagedAttention 论文 SOSP 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐提升</td>\n<td>最高约 24×</td>\n<td>vs 早期朴素连续分配实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对 HF/传统</td>\n<td>2–4× 更高吞吐</td>\n<td>高并发下常见区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开前缀缓存单项</td>\n<td>约 +30% 吞吐</td>\n<td>合适负载，vLLM 指南 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单卡吞吐</td>\n<td>约 8000 tok/s</td>\n<td>单张 A100 一个 vLLM 容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70B FP8 组合</td>\n<td>2200–2400 tok/s</td>\n<td>H100，128+ 并发，含 chunked prefill</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源分别见 <a href=\"https://intuitivepapers.ai/paged-attention/\">PagedAttention 论文</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.easecloud.io/ai-cloud/increase-throughput-with-vllm-serving/\">vLLM 吞吐指南 2026</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/llm-serving-optimization-continuous-batching-paged-attention/\">Spheron 2026</a>。读这些数字要抓两点：一是「24×」是相对早期最朴素实现、且叠加了连续批处理的综合结果，不能单独归给分页一项；二是绝对 tok/s 强依赖模型、精度、硬件、并发数，脱离条件谈数字没有意义。度量的纪律，就是永远带着条件读数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显存利用率-最能体现分页的指标\">显存利用率：最能体现分页的指标</h2><p>若只能挑一个指标衡量分页做得好不好，那是 KV 显存利用率——真正存了有效 token 的显存占已分配 KV 显存的比例。它直接对应碎片篇里的浪费，见 <a href=\"../foundations/kv-fragmentation\">KV 内存碎片之痛</a>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>利用率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>有效 token 占用的显存</mtext><mtext>已分配的 KV 显存</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{利用率} = \\frac{\\text{有效 token 占用的显存}}{\\text{已分配的 KV 显存}} = 1 - W_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利用率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已分配的</span><span class=\"mord\"> KV </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">显存</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效</span><span class=\"mord\"> token </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">占用的显存</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>连续分配下这个比值常年在 20–40%（浪费 60–80%），分页把它推到 96% 以上。利用率之所以是「体现分页」的最佳指标，是因为它剔除了模型、硬件的干扰，纯粹反映内存管理的效率。工程上可以通过引擎暴露的指标监控它——若利用率明显偏低，往往意味着 block-size 不当、预留过度或抢占频繁，是调优的入口，见 <a href=\"paged-attention-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量的陷阱与纪律\">度量的陷阱与纪律</h2><p>最后强调几条度量纪律，它们决定你的对比是否可信。其一，吞吐和延迟必须一起报——单看吞吐可能是拿延迟换来的，反之亦然。其二，一定要报百分位延迟（P50/P95/P99）而非平均值，因为抢占和长尾请求会让平均值掩盖尾部灾难。其三，负载要贴近真实——用固定长度的合成请求测出的数字，往往比真实的变长负载好看得多，因为变长负载才是碎片和抢占真正发威的地方。</p>\n<p>把这几条落实，你就能公平地评估分页在<strong>你的</strong>负载上到底值多少，而不是照搬别人的 24×。这套端到端的度量与成本模型，与更上层的服务优化目标一致，见 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/practice/cost-sla-optimization\">LLM 推理服务系统 · 成本与 SLA 优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个核心指标：TTFT（prefill 决定）、TPOT（decode 决定）、吞吐（系统总产出），须分开看。</li>\n<li>decode 是访存受限负载，靠堆批量摊薄权重搬运成本；批量由 KV 显存决定，故分页主要提吞吐、几乎不亏延迟。</li>\n<li>关键数字：浪费 60–80%→&lt;4%、最高约 24× 吞吐、前缀缓存单项约 +30%，但都须带条件读。</li>\n<li>KV 显存利用率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-W_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）是最能纯粹体现分页效率的指标，连续分配 20–40%，分页 &gt;96%。</li>\n<li>度量纪律：吞吐与延迟并报、报百分位而非均值、用贴近真实的变长负载。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/why-paged-attention\">为何分页注意力</a> — 显存决定批量决定吞吐的链条</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"continuous-batching\">连续批处理</a> — 吞吐提升的另一半来源</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/serving-metrics\">LLM 推理服务系统 · 服务指标</a> — 指标定义的系统视角</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/latency-anatomy\">AI 成本与延迟优化 · 延迟剖析</a> — 端到端延迟的拆解</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吞吐提升与度量：把机制翻译成数字","id":"吞吐提升与度量-把机制翻译成数字"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个必须分清的指标","id":"核心概念-三个必须分清的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"分页为何主要提吞吐","id":"分页为何主要提吞吐"},{"level":2,"text":"读懂那些数字","id":"读懂那些数字"},{"level":2,"text":"显存利用率：最能体现分页的指标","id":"显存利用率-最能体现分页的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的陷阱与纪律","id":"度量的陷阱与纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"连续批处理：把省下的显存立刻用满","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/practice/continuous-batching"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：参数、抢占与何时失灵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/practice/paged-attention-in-practice"}}